   ]
  },
  "nap_note": "No nap block. What varies across one of these frames is folds, not nap, so there is nothing here to measure however large the image is.",
  "coverage_note": "This listing offers 41 colours, and its own sample-set option is captioned \"Sample set 2026 ver (122 colors)\", so the range is around 122 and this is roughly a third of it. The other 81 are not for sale anywhere online that could be found: the seller’s store was searched for further DS102 listings and has none — their other suede listings are different products at other thicknesses (0.5, 0.7, 1, 1.4mm) or different cloths entirely, and the 122-colour set is specific to this listing rather than store-wide, since the Chamude listing carries its own separate sample swatch. Short of buying the physical sample set, the remaining 81 have no online source.",
